        "pull_request": {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/pulls/230",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/pull/230",
          "diff_url": "https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/pull/230.diff",
          "patch_url": "https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/pull/230.patch",
          "merged_at": "2025-07-11T20:40:03Z"
        },
        "body": "Fixes #https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/issues/148\r\n\r\nThe maximum dimension is given as a pair `(max_dim_a, max_dim_b)` (you can just specify a single integer if you want them to be the same). In each iteration, the bitstrings are picked in this order, until the maximum dimension is reached:\r\n- Explicitly requested bitstrings\r\n- Carryover bitstrings. If there are more carryover bitstrings than we can pick without exceeding the maximum dimension, we pick them randomly (uniformly without replacement).\r\n- Bitstrings sampled from the QPU. If there are more sampled bitstrings than we can pick without exceeding the maximum dimension, we pick them randomly (uniformly without replacement).",
        "reactions": {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/issues/230/reactions",
